ared; total-assignment local formulation"},{"key":"source_verification_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed</span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1.3"},{"key":"source_result","html":"finite sequences used in 1.3.12 and 1.3.17"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27</span><span>29</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43</span><span>45</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_date","html":"2026-10-13"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.1.8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>（语言，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\)</span> (assignments into the carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> (candidate function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assignment}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Assignment}_L\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assignment}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\ns\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Assignment}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\ns\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>By <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9b641c11eab6e875\" href=\"?note=9b641c11eab6e875\" title=\"17-df-assignment\">17-df-assignment</a>, the right-hand side means precisely\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|\\mathfrak{A}|\">\\(s:\\mathrm{Var}_L\\to|\\mathfrak{A}|\\)</span>.  No separate assignment class is introduced.</p>\n<p>原书 §1.3 使用足够长的有限序列；本地总赋值版本由有限限制及延拓对应。原书 Proposition 1.3.16 保证多余坐标不影响满足，相关证明见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ee38febe67086306\" href=\"?note=ee38febe67086306\" title=\"17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence\">17-lem-satisfaction-coincidence</a>。这里没有把 total assignment 误报为原书逐字定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"9b641c11eab6e875","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","